# Secret chapter "First Steps" (Imperfect Cell, Age 788 -> Age 763). Started by the Act 3 epilogue when Eighteen found
# all three memories (341 fruit stall, 370 Mt. Paozu, 371 Kame House) and spared the mother and son (344).
# Flags: 390 started, 391 woke, 392 Gero's recording, 393 Trunks defeated, 394 aftermath seen, 395 Trunks met,
# 396 Age 763 arrival seen, 397 burrowed (the end). Player = character 6 (BF Vegito's slot): form 39 = Imperfect Cell
# (actor player_cell = 275, form value 284); the larva = character 4 (BF Vegeta's slot) in form 27 (player_larva = actor 271, form value 280). Areas 17:25-17:31.
list fs_start
set_flag 390
do call 120 60
do call 183 516 1472 1473
do call 115 0 2 0 0 0; call 121 1
do call 151 6; call 149 6; call 152 1; call 152 3; call 157 6 284
do call 165 6 20; call 165 6 1; call 165 6 9; call 164 6 15; call 164 6 14
do heal
do call 120 1; call 119 17 25 1 208 312; call 121 60
stop
# ---------- the incubator (17:25 arrival)
list fs_wake
if_flag 391 wake_seen
set_flag 391
do heal
narrate Age 788. A room beneath Gero's bunker that was never on any map.
narrate Computer: Incubation complete. Specimen viable. Releasing.
narrate The glass cracks, then gives. Something unfolds itself onto the floor and stands up for the first time.
say cell_imperfect ...So this is what it is to have a body.
say cell_imperfect Goku's cells. Vegeta's. Piccolo's. Frieza's. I can feel all of them arguing inside me.
say cell_imperfect And two empty places, shaped exactly like Seventeen and Eighteen. The doctor left room for them.
say cell_imperfect I reach for them... and there's nothing there. Not hiding. Not sleeping. Gone.
say cell_imperfect No matter. Whatever I defeat, I can take into myself. A little strength at a time.
journal Find out what happened
do call 47; call 51 0
stop
label wake_seen
# ---------- the tank room (17:26)
list fs_pod16
say cell_imperfect Sixteen's pod. Empty, and scratched. Even the doctor's mistakes were taken away from him.
# ---------- the main lab (17:27): the backup console
list fs_computer
if_flag 392 computer_seen
set_flag 392
narrate A backup console in the wall flickers on the moment Cell touches it, as if it had been waiting for him.
say gero If you are hearing this, Cell, then Seventeen and Eighteen did not come back, and I am most likely dead.
say gero You are my masterpiece. Every great fighter on Earth, woven into one perfect body.
say gero But you are not finished. Absorb Seventeen and Eighteen, and you will be complete. Perfect.
say gero Then find Son Goku, and show him what my science can do.
narrate Computer: Additional log. Son Goku: deceased. Units Seventeen and Eighteen: destroyed, Age 785.
narrate Computer: Destroyed by: Trunks, of Capsule Corporation. Capsule Corporation is building a temporal displacement device.
say cell_imperfect A time machine.
say cell_imperfect Seventeen and Eighteen are dead here. But somewhere back there, they're still walking around.
say cell_imperfect Then that's where I'll go.
journal Find Trunks and his time machine
do call 47; call 51 0
stop
label computer_seen
say cell_imperfect Goku, dead. Seventeen and Eighteen, dead. The doctor, dead. The only one left is the boy with the sword.
# ---------- the way out (17:27 south corridor)
list fs_leave
unless_flag 392 leave_no
narrate The corridor ends in the lab's security wing. Things stir behind the consoles: Gero's cyborg guards, still on duty.
say cell_imperfect More of the doctor's leftovers. Good. I'm hungry.
do call 120 30; call 119 17 41 1 32 344; call 121 30
stop
label leave_no
say cell_imperfect Not yet. The doctor left something here for me. I can feel it.
# ---------- Trunks (17:28 arrival, fight in 17:29)
list fs_trunks
if_flag 395 trunks_seen
set_flag 395
narrate West City, Age 788. Three years of peace have started to grow over the ruins.
narrate A young man is loading capsules into a strange machine. A sword on his back. He turns around.
say trunks_a ...Who are you?
say cell_imperfect You must be Trunks. The one who destroyed Seventeen and Eighteen.
say trunks_b You've got Gero's mark on you. How many more of you did he leave behind?
say cell_imperfect Only one. The one he was saving for last.
say cell_imperfect You took my other halves from me, Trunks. So I'll take your machine. That seems fair.
say trunks_c This machine is going to tell the people I love that the nightmare is over. You're not touching it.
narrate His hair flares gold.
do heal; call 120 20; call 119 17 29 1 424 440; call 121 20
journal Defeat Trunks
do call 47; call 51 0
stop
label trunks_seen
# ---------- the time machine (17:30 arrival)
list fs_after
if_flag 394 after_seen
set_flag 394
narrate Trunks goes down hard, and he doesn't get up.
say trunks_d I beat them... I finally beat them... and you just...
say cell_imperfect Climbed out of a hole in the ground. I know. It hardly seems fair to you.
narrate Cell steps over him and climbs into the time machine. The controls are simple. They were built for a boy.
narrate There isn't room inside for something his size. So he makes himself small again.
narrate Light. Then nothing at all.
do call 120 90
do call 151 4; call 149 4; call 152 6; call 157 4 280
do call 119 17 31 1 128 220; call 121 90
stop
label after_seen
# ---------- Age 763 (17:31 arrival)
list fs_763
if_flag 396 arrive_seen
set_flag 396
do heal
narrate Age 763. A clearing in the woods outside a town called Gingertown.
narrate Something lands in the grass with a hiss of steam. A hatch opens, and something very small crawls out.
narrate No Seventeen. No Eighteen. Not yet. In this year they haven't even been built.
narrate So it will wait. It is very good at waiting.
journal Find somewhere to hide
do call 47; call 51 0
stop
label arrive_seen
list fs_burrow
set_flag 397
narrate The larva digs into the soft earth until the light is gone. Down there it is dark, and warm, and quiet.
do call 120 120; call 115 17 33 1 264 120; call 121 120
narrate Four years later, someone will find an empty time machine in these woods, and the shell of something that hatched.
narrate Not long after that, the people of Gingertown will start to disappear.
narrate In this world, a boy called Gohan and his friends have no idea what is coming.
narrate To be continued in Legacy of Goku II.
narrate Secret chapter complete.
run credits
stop
# ---------- the security wing (17:41, log4/gen_secret.py): the hangar door out
list fs_out
narrate The hangar door grinds open. Cell steps into the open air for the first time. Then he flies south, toward West City.
do call 120 60; call 119 17 28 1 424 440; call 121 60
# ---------- exit audit 2026-11-03: the Age 788 Security Wing's other ways out
list fs_door_sealed
set_flag 448
narrate The door to the pod room is buckled in its frame. It won't move.
list fs_lower_caved
set_flag 449
narrate The lower corridor has caved in. Rubble from floor to ceiling.
